GableLBM / OpenLBM Licensing
============================

Copyright (c) 2026 FutureBuild, Inc. and OpenLBM contributors.

This repository is NOT under a single license. Licensing is PER COMPONENT:
different directories are governed by different OpenLBM Standard licenses.

  - LICENSE-MAP.md    the authoritative directory -> license mapping
  - LICENSES/         the full text of every license referenced here
  - REUSE.toml        machine-readable form of the same mapping (REUSE 3.x)

Every source file also carries an `SPDX-License-Identifier` header naming the
license that governs it. When in doubt, that header and LICENSE-MAP.md control.

The full OpenLBM Standard and the canonical, counsel-reviewed license texts are
published at:

  https://github.com/FutureBuildAIinc/openlbm

The OpenLBM license texts under LICENSES/ are drafts pending counsel review and
are not yet effective as final legal instruments. Where these drafts and the
published Standard disagree, the published Standard governs.
